          <dt>Sources OK</dt><dd>Reuters/AP/AFP/CNBC/CNN plus State Dept or Iran MFA official statement. Switzerland roadmap alone does NOT count.</dd>
          <dt>Ambiguity</dt><dd>Further interim MOU, extension of 60-day window, or partial agreement without nuclear provisions = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO. Nuclear provisions signed but IAEA access "to be determined" = AMBIGUOUS-RESOLVE-AS-NO.</dd>
        </dl>
